# /etc/kopyya/aws-costs.env on the QA host only. Not secrets — no keys here;
# the collector uses the EC2 instance role. Every line is optional: the QA
# instance, its volumes and addresses are discovered from instance metadata.
#
# Once QA resources carry an activated cost-allocation tag, costs are taken
# from the tag instead (covers replaced resources from before the collector ran):
# QA_COST_TAG_KEY=kopyya:env
# QA_COST_TAG_VALUE=qa
#
# Only if the QA resources aren't in the collector's own region:
# QA_COST_REGION=us-east-2
